  "description": "The Release 29 1 is a big-wheeled ripper made for long days and big lines. This aluminum 29er is built on a 130mm travel Level Link suspension platform. We’ve adjusted the geometry for 29-inch wheels while keeping the same playful attitude of all our Level Link bikes. A RockShox 35 Silver suspension fork and a RockShox Monarch R rear shock soak up the rough stuff, while Sram SX Eagle drivetrain components keep you cranking. Our Blanchard wheelset is tubeless ready and comes with 2.3-inch wide Maxxis Minion tires for unwavering traction. When it’s time to slow down, SRAM Level hydraulic disc brakes keep you on your line all the way down the mountain.",
